# (build 131c) Two things the battle tables lost, both found by the JSON
# round-trip (docs/history.md, Build 131c):
#
# Dark Force's picture: his map is a nametable block 40 x 15, 1206
# bytes, and extract_battle.py read at most $400 of a frame, so the last
# 91 cells came out 0 -- the bottom of his jaw was missing (Mother
# Brain's picture lost its last rows the same way). The first shot has
# the jaw's tip at 169,109.
#
# Frames of more than sixteen pieces: battle.h kept 16 a frame and
# seventeen frames have more, up to 36. Gra's strike (Map_TechGraAttack)
# has 24 to 28; with 16 its lightning stopped short of the floor. Rolf
# at L40 against Dark Force (formation $102), Gra from the second page
# of his list: 60 ticks after FIGHT a bolt is at 245,131.

start battle 258
members Rolf
member Rolf 40
wait idle
shot 01_dark_force
expect pixel 169 109 $220    # the tip of his jaw (the backdrop's $200 before)
press down                   # STGY
press c
wait idle
press c                      # ORDR
wait idle
press c                      # Rolf
wait idle
press right                  # TECH
wait ticks 3
press c
wait idle
press up                     # NEXT
wait ticks 3
press c
wait idle
shot 02_tech_page_2          # RES GRA GITHU NAFOI
press down                   # GRA
wait ticks 3
press c
wait idle
expect screen battle
limit 3000
press c                      # FIGHT
wait ticks 60
shot 03_gra_strike
expect pixel 245 131 $C00    # a bolt (the backdrop's $200 before)
expect no-stderr PIECES_MAX
